# Maier watchmaking, customer since 2018 #

The Maier watchmaking is a key actor in the high-end watchmaking domain, selling the greatest brands in store as well through its online trading tools.

First mandate to answer to a need of support on an aging technology (Prestashop), Maier quickly untrust us for the whole redesign of its job application. We thus conceive and develop a tailormade online trade ecosystem, by anticipating the future evolution needs and showing a strong responsiveness against the customer's requests. Parallel, we also accompany them on architectural and hosting aspects.

